            "text": "Comment=\"Looks good\""
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "For [[p0]] and [[p1]] signal types, you must send the name of the Automation step to start or resume as the payload. For example:",
      "protected": [
